repository-code: >-
  https://github.com/Deliverome-Project/accessible-surfaceome
url: 'https://surfaceome.deliverome.org'
abstract: >-
  Pipeline, agents, and web viewer behind a consensus atlas of
  extracellularly accessible human plasma-membrane proteins.
  Five public surface-protein resources disagree substantially
  about which proteins reach the cell surface, agreeing on only
  188. A tool-free triage agent classifies every protein-coding
  human gene for surface accessibility, and a
  literature-anchored deep-dive pipeline turns each candidate
  into a structured, evidence-cited record with per-claim
  citations and precomputed deterministic structural features.
keywords:
  - surfaceome
  - cell surface proteins
  - plasma membrane
  - drug target discovery
  - antibody-drug conjugates
  - large language models
  - literature curation
  - bioinformatics
